  "name": "rust-grammar",
  "description": "A standalone lexical and syntactic specification for the Rust programming language (v0.10) featuring multiple parser implementations. It provides a Flex-based lexer alongside LL(1) and LALR(1) grammar definitions using LLnextgen and GNU Bison, respectively, to facilitate formal grammar validation and AST generation. The project includes a verification suite that compares output parity against the reference rustc implementation.",
